aarch64 Objective-C dispatch casts (CFURLCache).

Same arm64 rule as the Foundation change: OBJC_OLD_DISPATCH_PROTOTYPES is 0 on
arm64, so objc_msgSend must be called through a correctly-typed function pointer.
These CFURLCache bridges to the NSURLCache _cf_* methods relied on the uncast
form. Casting each call is a no-op on x86 and correct on both. (Matches the arm64
change in darling-cfnetwork upstream, whose base this pin is byte-identical to.)
